@startuml
' Formal lifecycle abstraction; matches Policy.lean and StateMachine.lean.
title Architecton — Proof-oriented RUP Phase State Machine
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Inception
Inception --> Elaboration : promote [requirementsReviewed && traceabilityReviewed]
Elaboration --> Construction : promote [designReviewed && formalSpecificationChecked]
Construction --> Transition : promote [proofChecked && conformancePassed && artifactBuilt]
Inception --> Inception : iterate / iteration++
Elaboration --> Elaboration : iterate / iteration++
Construction --> Construction : iterate / iteration++
Transition --> Transition : iterate / iteration++
Elaboration --> Inception : reviseRequirements / revision++; archive; invalidate
Construction --> Inception : reviseRequirements / revision++; archive; invalidate
Transition --> Inception : reviseRequirements / revision++; archive; invalidate
Inception --> Inception : reviseRequirements / revision++; archive; invalidate
note right of Transition
  Deployment validation is a distinct
  operational check AFTER promotion;
  it is not proof of deployed binaries.
end note
note bottom of Inception
  recordValidated(evidence) is a trusted
  external-validation event in the model.
end note
@enduml
